7/17/2024

Level 14: Three turn-ins (six minotaur horns) yielded 0% change in experience.

11/5/24

Lvl 22 Gnome Mage judged amiable - 2 turn ins, 4 mino horns was about 2.5 blue per turn in for a total of 5% xp. I went from 1% to 3% to 6%.

